(7245199, 1124739, 15511, '<td valign="top">Fortuitous capture. <br/>I was gonna comment that the color editing didn''t allow the fawn to "stand out" from the background very well. Then, when I opened your image in another application, I discovered that the color space was aRGB, and the colors were better, even though the greens are clearly over-saturated. I believe that for web viewing, these images should be sRGB. This image converted to sRGB <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1125272" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">quite well </a>in Photoshop.<br/>Regardless, it''s an above average entry.</td>', 'Fortuitous capture. I was gonna comment that the color editing didn''t allow the fawn to "stand out" from the background very well. Then, when I opened your image in another application, I discovered that the color space was aRGB, and the colors were better, even though the greens are clearly over-saturated. I believe that for web viewing, these images should be sRGB. This image converted to sRGB quite well in Photoshop.Regardless, it''s an above average entry.', '2014-07-29 02:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
