(7255243, 1125003, 119012, '<td valign="top">critique club:<br/> <br/>i''m not fond of this image, the subjects seem awkward and they lack that "cuteness" one expects from this moment. its not like you can pose them, though :)<br/> <br/>the colors and details all seem to blend together and the background bleeds into the subject so there is isn''t enough isolation of the subject to any appeal either.</td>', 'critique club: i''m not fond of this image, the subjects seem awkward and they lack that "cuteness" one expects from this moment. its not like you can pose them, though :) the colors and details all seem to blend together and the background bleeds into the subject so there is isn''t enough isolation of the subject to any appeal either.', '2014-08-26 08:54:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7255247, 1125107, 119012, '<td valign="top">critique club:<br/> <br/>you got second place so you know its a good image, i cant find much to dislike except maybe its a bit over sharpened for my tastes.<br/> <br/>great details, composition and colors.</td>', 'critique club: you got second place so you know its a good image, i cant find much to dislike except maybe its a bit over sharpened for my tastes. great details, composition and colors.', '2014-08-26 08:57:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7255251, 1125126, 119012, '<td valign="top">critique club:<br/> <br/>nice colors, i can make out the tadpole easy enough. not sure im big on the blown highlights as they tend to draw my eye away from the subject but knowing you that might be the intent :)</td>', 'critique club: nice colors, i can make out the tadpole easy enough. not sure im big on the blown highlights as they tend to draw my eye away from the subject but knowing you that might be the intent :)', '2014-08-26 09:00:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7255256, 1125083, 119012, '<td valign="top">Critique Club Review:<br/> <br/>Color Saturation and Hue: Colors are not realistic, but do work very well with this composition.<br/> <br/>Brightness and contrast: seems the highlights have been pulled way down and there is a lack of contrast<br/> <br/>Focus and depth of field: the deer appear a bit soft but that could be part of the processing<br/> <br/>overall its a nice image, its doens''t overly appeal to my tastes but you captured a nice moment.</td>', 'Critique Club Review: Color Saturation and Hue: Colors are not realistic, but do work very well with this composition. Brightness and contrast: seems the highlights have been pulled way down and there is a lack of contrast Focus and depth of field: the deer appear a bit soft but that could be part of the processing overall its a nice image, its doens''t overly appeal to my tastes but you captured a nice moment.', '2014-08-26 09:02:49.000000', NULL, 0);
